# Data files are binary: git never changes their line endings (Windows
# checkouts, including GitHub's Windows runners, convert text files to CRLF).
# This also covers the test files that are text pretending to be data
# (tests/data/not_a_mat.mat, tests/data/formats/not_an_image.png).
*.mat  binary
*.tif  binary
*.tiff binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
